  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovating for sustainable agrifood systems transformation: testing, learning and scaling integrated solutions across countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to accelerate agrifood systems transformation along the rural-urban continuum by strengthening national and local capacities to apply systems approaches in the design, coordination, implementation and adaptive management of agrifood policies and investments. It focuses on Uganda and Zambia, while generating global learning, by adapting policy tools, piloting integrated policy and investment portfolios across value chains and urban agrifood systems, developing systems-oriented monitoring and learning approaches and disseminating knowledge to enable scaling and replication.</narrative>
  </description>
